About Connect 4
---------------

Connect 4 is a 2 players game, where you must connect 4 tokens (more
detailed rules are available via the menu). 
One player can be simulated by the Series 3a

Installation
------------

- Copy the file Connect4.opa to your \APP\ directory
- Copy the file Connect4.dat to your \OPD\ directory
- If you want to use the sound option, 
  copy the file chimes.wve to your \WVE\ directory.

Install Connect4 using psion-I as usual.


Note: If you want to save disk space, don't copy Connect4.dat, this
will save 13KB disk space. On the other hand, if this file is not in
the \OPD\ directory (on any drive), Connect4 will need a (long)
initialisation phase.


